## Executive Summary

This sprint transformed Nucleus from a simple CLI tool into a **comprehensive Executive Function System** for the solo founder. We implemented the "Chairman vs. CEO" architecture, giving the AI agent (CEO) the tools to manage context, features, deployments, and brain hygiene while the user (Chairman) focuses on vision.

## Delivered Features (Phases 7-16)

### 1. Satellite View Dashboard (Phase 16)
**"The Navigation System"**

A unified, multi-dimensional view of the brain using tiered data loading and precomputed activity stats.

*   **Command:** `nucleus status`
*   **Flags:** `--minimal` (Depth), `--sprint` (Tasks), `--full` (Session)
*   **Key Tech:** O(1) activity summary lookup, sparkline generation, terminal width detection.

