### 2. Brain Consolidation (Phases 13-15)
**"The Sleep Cycle"**

Automated hygiene for the digital brain.

*   **Tier 1 (Archive):** `nucleus consolidate archive` - Moves `.resolved.*` backup files to cold storage (preventing clutter).
*   **Tier 2 (Propose):** `nucleus consolidate propose` - Detects redundant artifacts and duplicates, generating merge proposals.
*   **Automation:** Integrated into [nightly_agent.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/nightly_agent.py).

### 3. Session Management (Phase 12)
**"The Save Game"**

Persist and resume context across work sessions.

*   **Commands:**
    *   `nucleus sessions save "Context Name"`
    *   `nucleus sessions resume [id]`
    *   `nucleus sessions list`
*   **Data:** Stores active task, depth state, breadcrumbs, and "lit pathways".

### 4. Feature Map & Proofs (Phases 9-11)
**"The Ledger of Work"**

Track features, validation status, and generates proof of work.

*   **Feature Map:** `nucleus features list`, `nucleus features search`
*   **Proof System:** `nucleus features proof <id>` - Generates markdown proof with AI reasoning, files changed, and risk assessment.
*   **Schema:** `product`, [status](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/app.py#631-639), `deployment_url`, `validation_result`.

### 5. Render Poller (Phase 8)
**"The Deployment Monitor"**

Watches deployments so you don't have to.

*   **Functions:** [brain_start_deploy_poll](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2617-2632), [brain_check_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2633-2648), [brain_complete_deploy](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2649-2668)
*   **Smoke Test:** [brain_smoke_test](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2669-2683) - Verifies endpoint health after deploy.

### 6. Depth Tracker (Phase 7)
**"The Rabbit Hole Guardrail"**

Prevents getting lost in sub-sub-problems.

*   **Command:** `nucleus depth show`, `nucleus depth up/reset`
*   **Visual:** `🟢 ●●○○○` (Safe) vs `🔴 ●●●●●` (Danger)

