## Usage Guide (New Commands)

| Goal | Command |
|:-----|:--------|
| **See everything** | `nucleus status --full` |
| **Save context** | `nucleus sessions save "End of Day"` |
| **Resume work** | `nucleus sessions resume` |
| **Clean up brain** | `nucleus consolidate archive` |
| **Check feature** | `nucleus features proof feature_id` |

